WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Choose a laptop. Sharing is stopped.

00:04.000 --> 00:12.000
Select the already paired Windows laptop.
Device names and addresses are obscured.

00:12.000 --> 00:22.000
Tap Start sharing. GNSS reception and the Bluetooth listener start.

00:22.000 --> 00:26.000
The laptop connects and receives five GGA messages.
This indoor test transmits no-fix status.

00:26.000 --> 00:32.200
In a second session, expand the ShareGNSS notification.
Tap its Stop sharing action.

00:32.200 --> 00:34.400
Other notifications and the screen transition are concealed.

00:34.400 --> 00:40.000
Return to ShareGNSS. Location is paused and sharing is off.
